\c 47  
\d For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by the sons of Korah.  
\q1
\v 1 Oh clap \w your|strong="H1121"\w* hands, all you nations.  
\q2 Shout \w to|strong="H1121"\w* God \w with|strong="H1121"\w* \w the|strong="H1121"\w* voice \w of|strong="H1121"\w* triumph!   
